  (text "J1 pins 1-9: 3V3, GND, GPIO21/SDA, GPIO22/SCL, GPIO17/DS18B20, GPIO25/heater, GPIO26/humidifier, GPIO27/circulation fan, GPIO14/ventilation fan. J1 pins 10-17 follow the existing BTS7960, switches, buzzer, and status LED map." (at 45 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "f73d8244-69b7-43a8-84b5-349b113ad3c7"))
  (text "Each active-low GPIO drives one PC817 LED through R2-R5 (330 Ohm); R7-R10 pull CTRL up to isolated RELAY_VCC. Verify opto sink current." (at 45 214 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "738aaf93-1a81-47ce-8254-eb223a51e8ab"))
  (text "J4 RELAY_VCC/RELAY_GND belong to the external relay side; keep that supply and ground separate from MCU GND to preserve isolation." (at 45 223 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "86b0fc73-5564-443d-a69d-305e3d629d2d"))
  (text "J9 is a 12V DC input; F1 is in series; C1/C2 are bulk capacitors. U9 is a generic 12V-to-5V buck; J10 feeds DevKit 5V/VIN." (at 45 232 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "7c0079b4-cb3d-4619-8ac1-6c21396160e7"))
  (text "R11/R12 are optional I2C pull-ups; leave DNP if the sensor breakout already includes them. J8 ADC nets are reserved for firmware assignment." (at 45 241 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "40d745b5-ab27-4dc6-8a65-e2f2dc1bb54f"))
  (text "R1 is the DS18B20 pull-up; R13/D1 provide a GPIO2 status LED. Q1/R6 drive the 5V buzzer; J5 BTS7960 motor and logic returns are common." (at 45 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "b12d6c7a-b808-4828-a8e8-43186c701ff3"))
  (text "Module footprints, fuse/current ratings, PCB layout, thermal/clearance review, and mains/load wiring remain unspecified; this is not fabrication-ready." (at 45 259 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "ca0db027-2ffb-42ea-bf26-15c5fa96aaf4"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
